# Codex's repo skills dir. Codex Desktop's Claude Code import writes a rewritten
# copy of `.claude/skills` here; it is machine-local, never consumed by the build,
# and would leave every checkout dirty (teardown refuses dirty worktrees).
# Root-anchored: the vendored `src-tauri/resources/**/.agents/` bundles are tracked.
/.agents/

